| Global Id | Track | Driver Type/Pin | Constraint | Clock Loads | Non-Clock Loads | FF   | Memory LUTs | RAMB | DSP | GT | MMCM | PLL | Hard IP | Net      |
+-----------+-------+-----------------+------------+-------------+-----------------+------+-------------+------+-----+----+------+-----+---------+----------+
| g1        | n/a   | BUFG/O          | None       |        1106 |               0 | 1064 |          31 |   11 |   0 |  0 |    0 |   0 |       0 | IB_100M  |
| g2        | n/a   | BUFG/O          | None       |         445 |               0 |  356 |          78 |   11 |   0 |  0 |    0 |   0 |       0 | glblclk  |
| g3        | n/a   | BUFG/O          | None       |         183 |               0 |  182 |           0 |    1 |   0 |  0 |    0 |   0 |       0 | CLK_100M |
+-----------+-------+-----------------+------------+-------------+-----------------+------+-------------+------+-----+----+------+-----+---------+----------+
* Clock Loads column represents the clock pin loads (pin count). Internal cell leaf pins are not counted
** Non-Clock Loads column represents the non-clock pin loads (pin count)
*** Columns FF, LUTRAM, RAMB through 'Hard IP' represents load cell counts


